        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/2efab43c9df09b5cc18aabae023849bd.webp?t=1766150746\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Pinball Adventure is pinball like you've never seen. <br>Colorful, punchy and charming graphics join forces with fast-paced pinball action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action-packed retro arcade pinball adventure!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/526ebee37f1b7fdaef0ba8e488005657.poster.avif?t=1766150746\" width=400 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/526ebee37f1b7fdaef0ba8e488005657.webm?t=1766150746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/526ebee37f1b7fdaef0ba8e488005657.mp4?t=1766150746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dopamine hits and adrenaline rushes as coins and enemies fly around the screen!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 tables across 5  uniquely themed worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit enemies, collect coins and battle an epic boss at the end of each world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/539777a0824cac2b8720c196961aed9a.poster.avif?t=1766150746\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/539777a0824cac2b8720c196961aed9a.webm?t=1766150746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/539777a0824cac2b8720c196961aed9a.mp4?t=1766150746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your nudge power, combo and other stats to get the edge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for controllers (with rumble!) and Steam Deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/2efab43c9df09b5cc18aabae023849bd.webp?t=1766150746\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Pinball Adventure is pinball like you've never seen. <br>Colorful, punchy and charming graphics join forces with fast-paced pinball action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action-packed retro arcade pinball adventure!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/526ebee37f1b7fdaef0ba8e488005657.poster.avif?t=1766150746\" width=400 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/526ebee37f1b7fdaef0ba8e488005657.webm?t=1766150746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/526ebee37f1b7fdaef0ba8e488005657.mp4?t=1766150746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dopamine hits and adrenaline rushes as coins and enemies fly around the screen!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 tables across 5  uniquely themed worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit enemies, collect coins and battle an epic boss at the end of each world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/539777a0824cac2b8720c196961aed9a.poster.avif?t=1766150746\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/539777a0824cac2b8720c196961aed9a.webm?t=1766150746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.